      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 1]"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1020_swimmerm_02",
      "hash": "afd9541bd2e47b7c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1020_swimmerm_03",
      "hash": "afd9551bd2e47d2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_01",
      "hash": "a7661d11c28260fc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：因为听到别人说什么“哇哦～\\nGO Park里有好多罕见宝可梦耶！”，\\r\\n才专门赶到这里……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "63dae89e4730b568",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：结果却说什么手机应用，\\n什么连动啥的，各种听不懂……\\c\\n最后越听越害怕，\\n吓得我们就逃出来了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1020_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "9cf6c3ec7942f750",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵：喵……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "63daeb9e4730ba81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_02",
      "hash": "a7662011c2826615",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：不知道去哪\\n才能捞到赚大钱的活儿啊～"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_09",
      "hash": "a7662511c2826e94",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯？我怎么觉得脚底\\n踩着个什么硬邦邦～的东西……！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "63daea9e4730b8ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：说不定是什么宝贝！？\\n咱们把它挖出来看看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_03",
      "hash": "a7661f11c2826462",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：挖了嘿！挖了嘿！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "63daed9e4730bde7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1020_nyasu_02",
      "hash": "9cf6c6ec7942fc69",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_04",
      "hash": "a7661a11c2825be3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：哇噢～！金光闪闪的说～！\\n咱们挖到个了不起的宝贝啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_05",
      "hash": "a7661911c2825a30",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呃，这这！\\n这不是[VAR COLOR(0006)]假牙[VAR COLOR(0000)]嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "63daec9e4730bc34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：假、假牙～？\\n就算它再金，咱们也不需要假牙啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_06",
      "hash": "a7661c11c2825f49",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_07",
      "hash": "a7661b11c2825d96",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：啊，是小鬼头！\\n你在这里干什么啊！\\c\\n哎，无所谓你来干什么了，\\n你快把这个给我拿走啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1020_sys_02",
      "hash": "1ed557a826255042",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]被迫\\n收下了[VAR COLOR(0006)]金假牙[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_06",
      "hash": "63daef9e4730c14d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：那玩意儿就给你了！\\n我们可是很忙的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_08",
      "hash": "a7662611c2827047",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：我们快离开这个地方吧！\\n我想快点去洗个手！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1020_max",
